    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to bring to the market No. 84 A  Sunday’s Well Road. Situated in one of Cork City’s well-established and highly sought-after residential areas,  is a three-bedroom mid-terrace property offering an excellent opportunity for those looking to create a home to their own taste.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation, it provides a fantastic blank canvas with plenty of scope for updating and improvement. The accommodation offers well-proportioned living space together with three bedrooms, making it an ideal choice for families, first-time buyers or investors.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular highlight. Sunday’s Well is renowned for its proximity to Cork City Centre, while also offering convenient access to a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops and public transport links. The property is ideally positioned for those looking to enjoy the convenience of city living while remaining within an established residential setting.\r\n\r\nProperties in this location with the potential to be upgraded and modernised are always of interest, and No. 84A  presents an opportunity to put your own stamp on a home in a well-connected part of Cork City."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hall - \r\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nLiving room - \r\nUpstairs 4.8mx3.1m, Two windows to the front, carpet flooring, tiled fireplace.\r\n\r\nDining room - 5.3m x 2.1m \r\nLaminate flooring, tiled fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchenette - 2.1m x 2.0m \r\nFitted kitchen, stainless steel sink., Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nUtility - 1.5m x 1.5m \r\nPlumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nBathroom - \r\n3 piece suite  Lino floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 5.4m x 2.8m \r\nCarpet flooring, two windows.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.0m x 2.7m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.2m x 2.4m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Most sought after location\r\nClose to all services such as churches, schools, shops, and conveniently located 15 minutes walk to city centre\r\nGreat schools and sports amenities nearby.\r\nWell-proportioned accommodation\r\nThree-bedroom mid-terrace home\r\nExcellent Sunday’s Well location\r\nRequires modernisation\r\nExcellent potential to create a contemporary home\r\nSuitable for owner-occupiers or investors"
      }
    ],
